## 5. Property Vocabulary

### 5.1 Provenance Properties (All Layers)

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| source-tier | enum (T1–T8) | Source reliability tier from DD-EXT-2 hierarchy |
| source-ref | string | Specific source citation (filing number, URL, document title) |
| source-date | date | Date the source was published/filed |
| as-of | date | Date the assertion was valid (not when it was recorded) |
| stale-after | date | Computed from source-tier staleness window |
| filing-type | string | SEC filing type if applicable (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, S-1, DEF 14A, Form 4, 13F) |
| layer | enum | factbase, pattern, projection |

### 5.2 Financial Properties (Layer 1)

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| period | string | Fiscal period (FY2026, Q1-2026, H1-2026) |
| currency | string | Currency code (USD default) |
| amount | number | Dollar amount |
| growth-yoy | number | Year-over-year growth rate (decimal, e.g. 1.0 = 100%) |
| growth-qoq | number | Quarter-over-quarter growth rate |
| run-rate | number | Annualized run rate from partial period |
| burn-rate | number | Cash consumption per period |
| runway-months | number | Months of cash remaining at current burn |

### 5.3 Capital Raise Properties (Layer 1)

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| raise-type | enum | ATM, PIPE, shelf-registration, rights-offering, convertible-note |
| raise-amount | number | Gross proceeds |
| price-per-share | number | Offering price |
| dilution-pct | number | Percentage dilution to existing shareholders |
| participants | list | Known participants (from S-1 supplement, prospectus) |
| repeat-participant | boolean | Whether participant appeared in prior raises |
| insider-participation | boolean | Whether insiders participated |
| terms-favorability | enum | market, below-market, deep-discount |

### 5.4 Rumor Properties (Layer 1, T8 Only)

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| rumor-origin | enum | human-network, industry-chatter, anonymous-source, pattern-inference |
| corroboration-status | enum | unverified, partially-corroborated, corroborated, discredited |
| verification-vectors | list | Specific searches or data pulls that could corroborate or discredit |
| human-set-confidence | boolean | Always true for T8 — confidence was set by human, not by default |
| corroboration-evidence | list | Evidence found by verification searches (appended over time) |

### 5.5 Claim Properties (Layer 1, CLM- Nodes)

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| claim-text | string | Exact text of the claim as made |
| claim-date | date | When the claim was made |
| claim-channel | enum | press-release, earnings-call, investor-deck, linkedin, interview |
| verifiable | boolean | Whether the claim can be checked against T1/T2 data |
| verification-status | enum | unverified, confirmed, partially-confirmed, contradicted, quietly-dropped |
| verified-by | reference | Node ID of the T1/T2 fact that confirms or contradicts |

