| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| pattern-type | enum | sector-pattern, anti-pattern, leading-indicator |
| evidence-basis | list | Node IDs from Layer 1 that support this pattern |
| comp-basis | list | Comparable companies whose history demonstrates this pattern |
| historical-hit-rate | number | How often this pattern has predicted correctly (0.0–1.0) |
| time-horizon | string | Over what period the pattern plays out |
| invalidating_assumption | string | What premise, if changed, invalidates the pattern |

