| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| stated-frame | string | What the communication directs attention toward |
| baseline-frame | string | What matters at this company's actual stage and financial position |
| frame-gap | enum | none, low, moderate, high, extreme |
| suppressed-questions | list | Specific questions the framing avoids |
| jmt-score | number | Jedi Mind Trick score (0.0–1.0): degree of frame control detected |
