| ext.CLAIMS | entity | Management communication makes a specific claim |
| ext.CONTRADICTS_CLAIM | semantic | T1/T2 fact contradicts a management claim |
| ext.CONFIRMS_CLAIM | semantic | T1/T2 fact confirms a management claim |
| ext.DEPENDS_ON_PARTNER | causal | Company capability depends on a partnership |
| ext.RAISED_VIA | entity | Capital entered the company through this raise event |
| ext.PARTICIPATED_IN | entity | Investor participated in a capital raise |
| ext.DILUTES | causal | Capital event dilutes existing shareholders |
| ext.SUPERSEDES_ESTIMATE | temporal | New estimate replaces prior estimate for same metric |

### 6.2 Pattern Engine Edges

| Type | Layer | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| ext.INDICATES | causal | Leading indicator signals trajectory toward a pattern |
| ext.ANTI_INDICATES | causal | Anti-pattern signal masks true trajectory |
| ext.FRAME_CONTROLS | causal | Communication employs frame control on a topic |
| ext.SUPPRESSES | causal | Communication framing suppresses a relevant question |
| ext.CREDIBILITY_EVENT | temporal | Claim confirmation/contradiction updates credibility score |
| ext.COMPARES_TO | semantic | Company benchmarked against a comparable at similar stage |
| ext.CORROBORATES | semantic | Evidence supports a rumor |
| ext.DISCREDITS | semantic | Evidence discredits a rumor |
| ext.NARRATIVE_SHIFT | temporal | Messaging on a topic has changed direction |

### 6.3 Projection Edges

| Type | Layer | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| ext.FORECASTS | temporal | Projection estimates a future-period metric |
| ext.ASSUMES | causal | Projection depends on an explicit assumption |
| ext.INVALIDATES | causal | Observable event invalidates a projection or assumption |
| ext.RISKS | causal | Risk factor threatens an outcome |
| ext.CATALYZES | causal | Catalyst event could trigger a scenario shift |
| ext.DERIVED_FROM | semantic | Projection produced from specific factbase/pattern nodes |
| ext.COMPETES_WITH | semantic | Company or product competes directly with another |

